{"ASK_ALONE_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|hour=16,5",{"Tonight? I- yes, I think so, maybe, let me ask the others, wait here","Stay with us tonight? oh, I'd like that, the more people, the safer, but you have to be quiet!","It's getting late, so yes, come in, we can't have you out there, not in the dark","I want to say yes, I really do, but I can't decide alone, give me a minute"}},
{"ASK_ALONE_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|hour=16,5|world=door",{"You can sleep by the door, you take the first watch, and no weapons in the sleeping room"}},
{"ASK_ALONE_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|hour=16,5",{"Tonight, fine, but you leave at first light, and you don't take anything that isn't yours","We've got a corner, and a blanket, and a rule about snoring, okay?"}},
{"ASK_ALONE_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Stay? oh God, I don't know, I want to say yes, but I'm so scared, there are kids here","Maybe... let me ask my husband -- he's the cautious one, I'm the soft touch","We're full, I'm so sorry, we have no room, not an inch, I wish we did"}},
{"ASK_ALONE_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"A night, one night, then you're on your way, and we never speak of it","Depends what you bring, a story, a can, a pair of strong arms, the usual","We've done it before... folks stay, folks go, you can stay, but it's on your honor"}},
{"ASK_ALONE_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"Come in, come in, there's room, maybe even some tea left","Of course you can, you've been good to us, it's the least we can do"}},
{"ASK_ALONE_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"No, absolutely not","You? stay with us? no way","Find your own place -- and don't come back","No","You can sleep outside","I don't know you well enough"},false,false,{[4]={{t="not a chance",afterMs=3000}},[5]={{t="far from me",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_ALONE_NIGHT","role=civilian_loner|hour=4,9",{"I don't share a camp, but I don't mind if you pitch near, as long as you leave before dawn"}},
{"ASK_ALONE_NIGHT","role=rescue_medical",{"Sleep here, in the corner, but don't wake the patients, and don't touch the medicine cabinet"}},
{"ASK_ALONE_NIGHT","role=rescue_clergy",{"My door is open to every weary soul, so yes, stay, sleep, and in the morning, we'll talk"}},
{"ASK_ALONE_NIGHT","role=militia",{"Negative, we can't take overnighters, but there's a barn two hundred yards east"}},
{"ASK_ALONE_NIGHT","role=rescue_firefighter",{"We've got a spare bunk, but no promises, and you take the dishes in the morning"}},
{"ASK_ALONE_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best|hour=16,5",{"Tonight? of course, stay, stay as long as you need, you're always welcome!","Sure, we got a bed and a blanket, and a hot cup of... whatever it is we have","You don't even have to ask, you're always welcome here","Stay, stay, I insist, it's not safe out there, and I'd worry all night","Yeah, stay -- and good of you to ask first, most don't","There's room, there's always room for you","Sure thing, we've got extra blankets, and a spare pillow","We'd love to have you, we'd feel safer, honest","Stay the whole week, if you want, we'll make room!!","I'd be offended if you slept anywhere else tonight","Course you can, come on in, we got room","Stay, eat, sleep, you've earned every minute!","You're welcome, always, tonight and every night","Sleep easy, we'll take the watch, you've earned a rest","Come in out of the dark, quickly, quickly, sit by the fire","The guest room is yours, such as it is, it's got a lock!","Stay, please, we'd love the company, we haven't had a visitor in days","Absolutely, it's an honor, really!","Stay with us tonight, and as long as you need after!","Don't be silly, of course you can, sit down","Stay, if you want. I'd rather have you here tonight","Sleep well, you're among friends","Anytime, you know that","I'll tell the others, they'll be glad","Ain't much, but it's warm and nobody's gonna bother you there","I'd never turn you away, never","You can have my bed, I'll take the floor, I insist","Come on in, we're about to eat, and there's a plate for you"}},
{"ASK_ALONE_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best|hour=16,5|world=building",{"Come in, make yourself at home, take the cot by the stove!","There's soup on the stove, and a bed in the back, it's yours!"}},
{"ASK_ALONE_NIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst|hour=16,5",{"Absolutely NOT!","You? Stay here? Ha!","Find a ditch","No room, no way","I wouldn't sleep a wink with you under my roof!","Go on, get out of here before dark","Not here, not NOW, not ever!","Nope, find somewhere else","Sleep outside, with the rest of the vermin!","I'd rather sit up all night with a shotgun","Are you out of your mind?","Not under any circumstances!","Go away, before I fetch a bat!","We have no beds for your kind","The answer is no, and it'll always be no","The only thing I'm offering you is a warning","You wear out your welcome before you get one!!","Try the barn at the edge of town, I hear the rats won't mind","No, thanks, I like my things where I left them","Stay somewhere else, anywhere else","We don't take in strays that bite","You can wait in the ditch until morning","Never in a million years","You're asking me to risk my family -- NO","I'd leave a light on, but not for you","Keep walking, you'll find something","A place for you? There isn't one","I'd sooner burn the house down"}},
