{"ASK_AMMO","role=militia",{"I can't supply ammunition. Don't send someone else to ask"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","role=family_man,family_woman",{"I worry enough about keeping people safe without handing out ammunition"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"If I could help, you know I'd want to. I can't promise ammunition","I wish I could, you know I wish I could. Please don't count on me for this","Ammo's the one thing I can't spare, not even for you, and it kills me to say it!","You've been good to us, so I'll be straight: don't rely on me for ammunition","I'd split what I could with you. This isn't something I can offer","Honest to God, I'd like to help. Don't ask me to promise what I can't","I'm sorry, friend, it's the one question I can't say yes to","Try asking people who know about ammunition. I wish I had a better answer","I won't promise rounds to anybody, even somebody I trust","If you find some, share the news, we're all hungry for it","Maybe somebody else can help. Ask them, don't take my guess as a promise","I don't want to suggest a number and have you plan your life around it","You've earned an honest answer: I can't supply you, and I won't speak for my neighbors","Ask around, carefully. I don't know anybody I can send you to with a promise","I won't lie to you. I'm not agreeing to give ammunition away","I wish my answer was different. I can't agree to that","I'd feel worse pretending I could help","Ammunition worries everybody. I won't guess what you've got","I can show you how to make do without, it's tricky, but it's possible","Don't ask me to choose between being generous and being careful","I can't agree to that, and I'm sorry. You know I am","Be careful with what you have, you'll need it","Anything else you need -- ask, but not that","I've seen what happens when people stop being careful about ammunition","Sorry, friend, truly. I can't be your answer this time","I wish I could be more helpful, I really do","Ask me for anything else, anything at all","I'd help if I could. I don't want you counting on something I can't promise","Believe me, if I had it, it'd be yours!","I can't offer ammunition. I wish saying it felt better"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"Ammo? Ha! I wouldn't give you a rock","Last person I gave a bullet to shot me in the leg","No way, you'd turn it on us","Not a chance, go find your own","I'd sooner lose a finger than give you ammo","You want ammunition? I'm not helping you become more dangerous","Ask the people you've shot at","Why would I arm someone like you?!","The answer is no, and it'll stay no","I'm not feeding your habit","Find your ammunition elsewhere. I don't like what you do with it","Don't speak as though anybody here owes you a round!","Go ahead and starve your gun","You'd shoot first and ask later","Whether I have any isn't your business. The answer is no","No bullets for you","Get away from me","Your reputation says no","Hmm, let me think, no, never, no","I'd rather throw it in the river than hand it over","I don't like what people say about you and weapons","Try begging someone who doesn't know you","That's rich!","Not for money, not for love, not for anything","Ha! Not a chance!","Keep your hands to yourself!","You'll have to ask someone else. Don't send them back to me","Running low? Good luck getting sympathy from me","I don't arm trouble","Try a pawn shop, if there's one left"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"Ammo? Not now! Ask me again when they're dead","I can't help with ammunition, I'm so sorry","If I had it, I'd use it, I'd be using it!","Count what you can rely on. Don't count on me for more"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=player_armed",{"Running low? Make every shot count, then"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Spare ammo? Ha! You want bullets, you go find your own, I'm not running a charity","I'm not agreeing to hand ammunition out. Keep asking and this gets less polite","Ammo's worth more than gold these days, what are you offering?","You're asking me to help arm you? That's brave, or stupid","I'm careful with ammunition, and I'm not agreeing to hand you any","Bullets cost blood, {g:pal|lady}, mine or someone else's, which do you want to pay with?"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"You want ammunition from me? You'll get a threat, not a favor","Keep pushing and this conversation turns ugly"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Honestly, I don't like handing ammunition to strangers. You understand","I'm careful about it, {g:man|lady}. The thought of running out scares me"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","role=raider_boss,gang_boss,biker_boss|st=neutral,careful",{"Ammunition is power, and I don't hand out power to people I haven't tested"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Ammo? Every bullet matters. I'm not promising you any","You can't get bullets from me. You'll have to ask someone else","I'm the person answering, and the answer is no","No rounds to spare for you. Don't keep asking"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Want ammunition? Keep that tone and you'll regret asking"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"Nah, don't count on me for that. You understand?"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"We keep our ammo for ourselves, {g:brother|sister}, you'll have to find your own","I'm not agreeing to give ammunition away. Leave it there","Try asking at a pawn shop, if you find one. I don't know what anybody has left"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Oh, you'll get a bullet, but you won't like how"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Tell you what, {g:brother|sister}, if you've got something to trade, I might part with a few"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"We can talk about a price. Don't mistake talking for a sale","I might look into it. Don't make plans on that alone","I don't give things away, I exchange them"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"I might consider a trade. We'd have to see what was actually available"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Ammo? I'd rather you asked somebody who wants to discuss it","Don't ask. I don't want to get into ammunition with you","Don't ask me for weapons, I'll tell the guards, I mean, the Army, I mean, no one","Guards left the armory open when they ran, you should've seen us, you can't have any"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Back off. I'm not discussing what I may or may not have"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"I'd help if I could. Honest to God, don't count on a promise from me"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Ammo is life, and I'm not about to part with mine","Maybe we can discuss a trade. We haven't agreed on anything yet","I can't agree to supply you. Don't keep pushing"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"Whatever I may have, I'm not offering it to you"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"I'm not authorized to hand ammunition out","You'll have to find another source. I'm not offering","Civilians aren't authorized to receive department-issued ammunition"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=law|st=hostile",{"You want to talk about ammunition? First stop crowding me"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=law|st=friendly",{"I wish I could help. I can't promise you that"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral,careful",{"I'm not handing ammunition out. Don't ask the others on my account"}},
