{"ASK_AMMO","role=mercenary|st=neutral,careful",{"Ammo costs, and I don't give discounts"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"I don't give out ammunition. That's my answer","I don't want an argument about what belongs to whom"}},
