{"ASK_AMMO","reg=family|role=family_elder|st=friendly|world=building",{"I remember Papaw keeping shells in a coffee can. No idea where they ended up"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"You could ask at a bait shop. I don't know what any of them have left"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=worker|st=neutral",{"I'm used to tools, not ammunition. Don't count on me for this"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=rescue|st=neutral,careful",{"I'd rather help the people who get hurt than hand out ammunition"}},
{"ASK_AMMO","reg=rescue|role=rescue_clergy|st=neutral,friendly",{"Not from a church - not ever, you can pray with me instead"}},
