{"ASK_BASE","reg=raider|st=friendly,neutral",{"A place you won't find unless we want you to","Our place is wherever yours was - where's yours, by the way?"},false,{[2]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_BASE","reg=gang|st=friendly,neutral",{"A block you don't want to enter","The block - our block, you been standing on it for ten minutes"}},
{"ASK_BASE","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral",{"The clubhouse, bikes outside, music inside","The clubhouse, you hear the pipes, you're close, you see the bikes, you're too close"}},
{"ASK_BASE","reg=crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'd tell you, but then I'd have to charge you","We have an office, an office doesn't need a sign"}},
{"ASK_BASE","reg=prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"I don't have a place, I have a corner","Anywhere without bars, tried a motel - too much like a cell, we got a farmhouse now"}},
{"ASK_BASE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Where do I live? I- I don't have a place anymore, I sleep wherever there's a lock","Just a house, a regular one, and I'm sorry, I'm not telling you which","We've got a spot, it's small, and it's full, and I'd lie if I said we had room","Somewhere safe... I hope, I'm NOT sure it's safe, but it's ours","It's a long walk... and I'm not telling you the way, it'd put the kids in danger!","We moved three times already, I'm not saying where we are now","My place got overrun, so now I'm just, drifting, from roof to roof","Back that way, past where the road bends, and no, I won't draw you a map"}},
{"ASK_BASE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"We hold a place nearby, not far, not close, not for visitors","More or less a camp, and we keep it hid","Out of the way, that's the key, nobody finds what they're not looking for","Three families in one house, rules on the wall, a watch schedule, it works","You'll see it once I know you, not before, and don't take it hard"}},
{"ASK_BASE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly",{"It's nothing fancy, but you're welcome to visit, once I know you a bit better!!","Come by sometime, there might be coffee, if I have any, and we'll talk"}},
{"ASK_BASE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"You think I'd tell a stranger where I sleep?","Find your own, and don't follow me","I don't have a base, and I don't have anything for you","Not telling!!","I don't have one","You'll NEVER find it","Where I sleep is for me to know!!","Back off, that's not for you to know","Why do you need to know? I'm not telling","Somewhere safe, that's all you get"},false,false,{[4]={{t="don't even think about it",afterMs=2800}},[5]={{t="and if I did, you'd be the last to know",afterMs=3000}},[6]={{t="so stop looking",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_BASE","role=civilian_loner",{"A shack up the holler... no road, no neighbors, no windows facing the trail","A hunting cabin, I fixed it up, and nobody else knows it's there","I don't, I move, a different spot every few nights, a different tree, a different ditch"}},
{"ASK_BASE","role=family_man,family_woman",{"Our house -- still our house, we've barricaded the doors, and nailed the windows, and I'm not letting anyone in","It's a farmhouse, out past the pasture, and we've got a good view, and a good dog"}},
{"ASK_BASE","role=family_elder",{"My own home... honey, same house for fifty years, they'll have to carry me out"}},
{"ASK_BASE","role=family_youth",{"Uh... I can't tell you, my cousin would kill me, it's a secret, like a real secret.."}},
{"ASK_BASE","role=worker",{"We've set up at the plant... the offices upstairs -- the loading dock's welded shut"}},
{"ASK_BASE","role=rescue_medical",{"A clinic, of sorts, in the basement of the church, but we're full, I'm sorry..."}},
{"ASK_BASE","role=rescue_clergy",{"The church, always the church, the doors are unlocked during the day"}},
{"ASK_BASE","role=rescue_firefighter",{"The station, bay doors down, crew inside, but we can't take everybody"}},
{"ASK_BASE","role=militia",{"Post's about a mile from here, but it's not open to the public"}},
{"ASK_BASE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"You? You're welcome to see it one day soon, you'll know it by the smell of stew","It's our home, and it's yours too, whenever you need it","Honestly, I'd like for you to know where it is, in case of trouble","It's not far, and it's not much, but it's safe, and you'd be welcome","Smoke from a chimney, a lantern in the window, you'd know it when you saw it!","We have a signal, two flashes, ask me when you're ready to visit","We're hidden, but not from you, you're one of ours","It's a quiet spot, and you'd be welcome, ask me and I'll tell you the way when it's time","It's secure -- it's warm, and we have room, so please, come","We've got a good place, and a good crew, and we've got you, in our hearts","I'd tell you more, but I'd have to show you, come by anytime, ha","It's not far, and not hard to reach, once you know the way","I trust you with the location, which is saying something!!","It's a bit of a walk, but it's worth it, I promise, heh","It's a house like any other, plus a dog, and a lot of people who'd welcome you","You can find us by the sound of a banjo, if the wind is right","When you come, knock, say your name, and wait for the answer","You'd like it, it's an ordinary place, with extraordinary people","It's yours as much as ours, go on, make yourself at home","Folks like you always find us, somehow","We're closer than you think, and farther than you'd like","It's not hidden, not from friends, come visit","Our door's open, and so's our heart","Ask around for a friend of mine -- and the right door opens!","We're not hard to find, if you know who to ask","Stop by anytime, we'd love the company","It's a little rundown, but it's ours, and you're welcome","It's got a sturdy lock, a warm stove, and a crew you'd like","A home, such as it is, with a clothesline and a cat","You'll love it, it's not fancy, but it's cozy","Come sup with us, and see for yourself"}},
{"ASK_BASE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral|rep=bad,worst",{"Yeah, right, like I'd tell you where I sleep","Not a chance","Find your own place, and stay away from mine","I'd burn it down before I let you in","That's for me and mine to know","You don't deserve the answer","Go bother somebody else","Where I sleep is my own business","Keep out of it","Get lost","Not telling you, not ever","You'd rob us blind","I know what you're after","I'd rather not","Ask me again, I dare you","We're NOT on the map, and we're not for you!","A place that doesn't want you, that's where","Don't even think about it","Behind a wall, behind a gun, behind a locked door, that's all you need to know","It's a place where you're not welcome","I live somewhere you'll never find","Somewhere far from you, thank God","It's not for visitors, especially you","Ha! No","You'll NEVER get an address from me","It's under watch, so don't come near","That's classified, and you're not cleared","My home is my business","Leave it alone","Out of range -- out of reach, out of luck","You'll find out the hard way if you come looking!","Nope... nope, not telling"}},
{"ASK_BASE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=recent_zombie_contact",{"Not there, not now, they might follow, I won't lead them home","I'm not going home until they're gone, they'd see me!!","M-my base is a secret... and today it's more of a secret than ever","Don't ask, don't ask, they could HEAR"}},
{"ASK_BASE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|fact=player_armed",{"Our people would be glad to meet someone with your skills"}},
{"ASK_BASE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=22,4",{"Not at night, not telling a stranger where I sleep in the dark","You'll see me home at dawn"},false,false,{[2]={{t="maybe",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_BASE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=19,21",{"I'm on my way there now","It's close, and I'm heading in"},false,false,{[1]={{t="before dark",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_BASE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"I'm not telling, they might be listening, they might follow me","If I tell you, they'll find us, I know they will!"}},
{"ASK_BASE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"It used to be a house","We had a farm, a good one.."},false,false,{[1]={{t="now it's a place to sleep",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="now we have a shed",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_BASE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"Why do you want to know? so you can ruin it like EVERYTHING else?","It's mine, it's the last thing I've got, and I'll defend it!!"}},
